# --- pipeline/ -------------------------------------------------------------
# The retrieval engine is a second npm package inside this repo: its own
# package.json, its own dependencies, its own install. `node_modules` and `.env`
# above match at any depth, but these need naming explicitly.

# The Kaggle source CSV for Tier 2 (11.7MB). Re-downloadable, and its licence is
# unchecked for redistribution — pipeline/ARCHITECTURE.md says so. The derived
# pipeline/data/dishes.json is what the code actually reads, and is committed.
pipeline/data/raw/

# Generated authoring sheets — regenerate with npm run make-today
pipeline/data/make-today-sheet.md
.vercel
# Every real env file, at any depth. The two examples are tracked on purpose,
# and a plain `.env*` also swallowed any new example file silently.
.env.*
!.env.example
!pipeline/.env.example

EXPLANATION.md
LOCAL_AGENTS.md
TASK.md
.serena/
.docs/

# graphify knowledge-graph outputs — regenerate with /graphify .
graphify-out/
# gstack browse skill session state (holds a local token)
.gstack/
